    OBSERVE     → log + history only
    QUEUE       → FrontLock.enqueue or FSMTurnState.enqueue_result
    DEAD_LETTER → reject + emit dead_letter event"]:::flow

  HANDLER_DISPATCH["Handler Dispatch
    _on_user_input()        → Classification + Front routing
    _on_task_dispatch()     → Task registration + Orchestrator routing
    _on_task_complete()     → 12-step canonical ordering (M8 adaptive weave)
    _on_task_failed()       → Failure handling + cancel dedup
    _on_task_cancel()       → Cancel from Front
    _on_task_suspended()    → HITL entry (legacy/crash-recovery)
    _on_task_resume()       → HITL exit (legacy/crash-recovery)
    _on_hil_request()       → Unified HIL request (E4)
    _on_dag_completed()     → Normalize orchestrator DAG events
    _handle_interrupt()     → Arbiter-based interrupt routing
